</style></head><body class="flex min-h-screen flex-col"><header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-primary-200 bg-surface/95 backdrop-blur"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-500 font-bold text-ink-900">邱</span><span class="text-lg font-bold text-ink-900">邱建富</span></a><nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 lg:flex"><a href="/#hero" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">首頁</a><a href="/#about" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">關於邱建富</a><a href="/achievements" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">施政成果的里程碑</a><a href="/#policies" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">核心政見</a><a href="/news" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">最新消息與相關報導</a><a href="/media" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">影音專區</a><a href="/#donate" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 transition-colors hover:text-primary-600">支持我們</a></nav><a href="#donate" class="hidden rounded-full bg-accent-500 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:bg-accent-600 lg:inline-block">支持捐款</a><!-- 手機版選單開關 --><button id="mobile-menu-button" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-ink-200 lg:hidden" aria-label="開啟選單" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg></button></div><nav id="mobile-menu" class="hidden flex-col gap-1 border-t border-primary-200 bg-surface px-4 py-3 lg:hidden"><a href="/#hero" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">首頁</a><a href="/#about" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">關於邱建富</a><a href="/achievements" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">施政成果的里程碑</a><a href="/#policies" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">核心政見</a><a href="/news" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">最新消息與相關報導</a><a href="/media" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">影音專區</a><a href="/#donate" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700 hover:bg-primary-50">支持我們</a><a href="#donate" class="mt-2 rounded-full bg-accent-500 px-5 py-2 text-center text-sm font-bold text-white">支持捐款</a></nav></header><script type="module">var e=document.getElementById(`mobile-menu-button`),t=document.getElementById(`mobile-menu`);e?.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=t?.classList.contains(`hidden`);t?.classList.toggle(`hidden`),t?.classList.toggle(`flex`),e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(!!n))});</script><main class="flex-1"><section id="hero" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf><!-- 裝飾用漸層光暈，純 CSS，不需要圖片 --><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 -right-32 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-primary-300/40 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf></div><!--
    候選人形象照（桌面版）：滿版貼齊螢幕右側，左緣用漸層淡出融入背景色，
    不用外框、不用圓角卡片，效果類似「照片直接融進頁面」而不是「一張裝框的照片」。
