en rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 bg-surface shadow-sm"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="邱建富有能力、會做事18年解決不了，8個月做到！" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/4;background:#181818;object-fit:contain;"><source src="https://chiuchienfu.tw/videos/2026-10-16-second-columbarium.mp4" type="video/mp4">您的瀏覽器不支援影片播放，請使用下方連結觀看。</video><div class="p-5"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary-600">官網影音</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-base font-bold text-ink-900">邱建富有能力、會做事18年解決不了，8個月做到！</h3><a href="https://chiuchienfu.tw/videos/2026-10-16-second-columbarium.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 underline">開啟影片 →</a></div></article></div></div></section><section id="donate" class="py-20"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8"><!-- 捐款區塊 --><div class="rounded-3xl bg-ink-900 p-8 text-white sm:p-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">支持邱建富，一起打造更好的彰化</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-200">您的每一分支持，都是推動彰化前進的力量。歡迎透過以下政治獻金專戶小額捐款支持。</p><!-- 政治獻金專戶資訊 --><dl class="mt-8 divide-y divide-ink-700 rounded-2xl border-2 border-primary-500 bg-ink-800/60"><div class="px-5 py-4"><dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-primary-400">戶名</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-bold leading-snug">115年彰化縣縣長擬參選人邱建富政治獻金專戶</dd></div><div class="px-5 py-4"><dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-primary-400">銀行</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base font-bold">彰化府前郵局（代碼 700）</dd></div><div class="px-5 py-4"><dt class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-primary-400">帳號</dt><dd class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide text-primary-400 sm:text-3xl">0081038-0488984</span><button type="button" id="copy-account" data-copy="00810380488984" class="rounded-full bg-primary-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-ink-900 transition-colors hover:bg-primary-400">複製帳號</button></dd><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-300">跨行轉帳請輸入銀行代碼 700，帳號 00810380488984（共 14 碼）</p></div></dl><p class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-accent-500/15 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-accent-100">⚠️ 本競選團隊唯一的政治獻金專戶如上，不會以電話、簡訊或私訊要求您匯款至其他帳戶。</p><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-300"><li>匯款後請來電競選辦公室，提供姓名、身分證字號及地址，以便開立收據並依法申報。</li><li>依《政治獻金法》，外國人、大陸地區及港澳人民或團體、公營事業、未具選舉權之人等，不得捐贈。</li><li>競選辦公室電話：<a href="tel:04-7631090" class="font-bold text-primary-400 underline">04-7631090</a></li></ul></div><!-- 志工招募表單 --><div class="rounded-3xl border border-primary-200 bg-surface p-8 sm:p-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900 sm:text-3xl">加入志工行列</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">不管是掃街、文宣、活動支援，都需要您的參與。填寫表單，我們會盡快與您聯繫。</p><form id="volunteer-form" class="mt-8 space-y-5" data-mailto="chiuwenhsuan@gmail.com" data-subject="志工報名" data-key="917fcd87-815e-4231-b870-d53499e4c219"><!-- 防垃圾訊息用的隱藏欄位，真人不會看到也不會勾 --><input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="hidden" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"><div><label for="volunteer-name" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink-700">姓名</label><input id="volunteer-name" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="請輸入您的姓名" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-200"></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><label for="volunteer-phone" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink-700">聯絡電話</label><input id="volunteer-phone" name="phone" type="tel" required placeholder="09xx-xxx-xxx" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-200"></div><div><label for="volunteer-email" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink-700">Email</label><input id="volunteer-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-200"></div></div><fieldset><legend class="mb-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink-700">有興趣的參與方式</legend><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-600 hover:border-primary-400"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="掃街拜票" class="accent-primary-500">掃街拜票</label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-600 hover:border-primary-400"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="文宣製作" class="accent-primary-500">文宣製作</label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-600 hover:border-primary-400"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="活動支援" class="accent-primary-500">活動支援</label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-600 hover:border-primary-400"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="網路社群" class="accent-primary-500">網路社群</label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-600 hover:border-primary-400"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="其他" class="accent-primary-500">其他</label></div></fieldset><div><label for="volunteer-message" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink-700">想對我們說的話（選填）</label><textarea id="volunteer-message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="歡迎留言" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-200"></textarea></div><button type="submit" id="volunteer-submit" class="w-full rounded-full bg-primary-500 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-ink-900 transition-colors hover:bg-primary-400 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-60">送出報名</button><p id="volunteer-status" class="hidden rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed" role="status"></p><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-400">送出後，報名資料會直接寄到競選團隊信箱，我們會盡快與您聯繫。如有問題，也可來電<a href="tel:04-7631090" class="font-bold text-ink-600 underline">04-7631090</a>。</p></form></div></div></section><script type="module">var e=document.getElementById(`copy-account`);e?.addEventListener(`click`,async()=>{let t=e.textContent;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(e.dataset.copy??``),e.textContent=`已複製 ✓`}catch{e.textContent=`請手動複製`}setTimeout(()=>e.textContent=t,2e3)});var t=document.getElementById(`volunteer-form`),n=document.getElementById(`volunteer-submit`),r=document.getElementById(`volunteer-status`),i=(e,t)=>{r&&(r.innerHTML=t,r.className=`rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed ${e?`bg-primary-100 text-ink-900`:`bg-accent-100 text-accent-700`}`)};t?.addEventListener(`submit`,async e=>{e.preventDefault();let r=new FormData(t);if(r.get(`botcheck`))return;let a=String(r.get(`name`)??``).trim(),o={access_key:t.dataset.key,subject:`${t.dataset.subject}－${a}`,from_name:`邱建富官網志工報名`,姓名:a,聯絡電話:r.get(`phone`),Email:r.get(`email`)||`（未填）`,有興趣的參與方式:r.getAll(`areas`).join(`、`)||`（未選）`,想對我們說的話:r.get(`message`)||`（未填）`};n&&(n.disabled=!0,n.textContent=`送出中…`);try{let e=await(await fetch(`https://api.web3forms.com/submit`,{method:`POST`,headers:{"Content-Type":`application/json`,Accept:`application/json`},body:JSON.stringify(o)})).json();if(!e.success)throw Error(e.message);t.reset(),i(!0,`✓ 報名已送出，謝謝您的支持！我們會盡快與您聯繫。`)}catch{let e=Object.entries(o).filter(([e])=>![`access_key`,`subject`,`from_name`].includes(e)).map(([e,t])=>`${e}：${t}`).join(`
`);i(!1,`送出失敗，請<a href="${`mailto:${t.dataset.mailto}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(o.subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(e)}`}" class="font-bold underline">改用 Email 寄送報名</a>，或直接來電。`)}finally{n&&(n.disabled=!1,n.textContent=`送出報名`)}});</script></main><footer class="bg-ink-900 text-ink-100"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8"><div><p class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-400">邱建富</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-300">2026 彰化縣長候選人・無黨籍</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-300">產業升級、青年返鄉、世代共好</p></div><div><p class="font-bold text-primary-400">聯絡資訊</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm text-ink-300"><li>競選總部：彰化市中央路221號</li><li>聯絡電話：<a href="tel:04-7631090" class="hover:text-primary-400">04-7631090</a></li></ul></div><div><p class="font-bold text-primary-400">關注我們</p><div class="mt-3 flex gap-3"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/ChenfuChanghua/?locale=zh_TW" class="rounded-full border border-ink-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-200 transition-colors hover:border-primary-400 hover:text-primary-400">Facebook</a><a href="#" class="rounded-full border border-ink-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-200 transition-colors hover:border-primary-400 hover:text-primary-400">YouTube</a><a href="#" class="rounded-full border border-ink-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-200 transition-colors hover:border-primary-400 hover:text-primary-400">Instagram</a><a href="#" class="rounded-full border border-ink-600 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-200 transition-colors hover:border-primary-400 hover:text-primary-400">LINE</a></div></div></div><div class="border-t border-ink-800 px-4 py-4 text-center text-xs text-ink-400 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">本網站由邱建富競選辦公室維護。© 2026 邱建富競選團隊。</div></footer></body></html>